flowchart TD
    subgraph VOICE["Live conversation continues while research runs"]
        PERSON["Listener"] -->|Speak or interrupt| PLAYER["React player: pause and resume at the saved position"]
        PLAYER -->|WebRTC microphone and story context| LIVE["ElevenAgents Realtime Mini: clarify and give progress while evidence is pending"]
        LIVE -->|Live conversational audio| PLAYER
        PLAYER -->|One audible stream and synced source cards| PERSON
    end

    LIVE -->|Async research webhook| API["FastAPI: enqueue research and track the current question"]
    PLAYER -->|Active story and session context| API
    API -->|Job status and errors over SSE| PLAYER
    PLAYER -->|Non-interrupting status update| LIVE

    subgraph RESEARCH["Background research and verification"]
        LOOKUP["Retrieve a small set of relevant original passages"]
        LOOKUP --> DRAFT["Lower-cost text LLM drafts claims with article IDs and quotes"]
        DRAFT --> VERIFY["Check quotes, figures and claim meaning; flag source conflicts"]
        RELEASES["Relevant official releases"] --> VERIFY
        VERIFY -->|Approved wording and claim citations| CURRENT{"Is this still the current request?"}
    end

    SOURCES["Multilingual news articles"] --> INDEX["Batch deduplicate, group and index evidence"]
    INDEX --> LOOKUP
    API -->|Question and active story ID| LOOKUP
    LOOKUP -->|Insufficient evidence| API
    VERIFY -->|No supported answer remains| API
    CURRENT -->|Superseded| DISCARD["Discard stale result"]
    CURRENT -->|Current| RENDER["Reuse cached audio or use ElevenLabs TTS on approved text"]
    RENDER -->|If still current, play clip with source cards| PLAYER
    PROFILE["Listener profile and format"] --> RANK["Rank and select stories for the listener"]
    INDEX --> RANK
    RANK --> DRAFT
    RENDER -->|Cache verified briefing clips| BRIEFING["Pre-rendered briefing clips"]
    BRIEFING --> PLAYER
